l101: $ uadm u , w ∊ lvals , r ∊ sat u (mcv H) (enc_ctx G) w ⇒ dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (pi (srt (ls lz)) (pi (pi (bvar nz) (ind_ty (pset_D b) nz)) (ind_ty (pset_D b) nz)))) w r = dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (pi (srt (ls lz)) (pi (pi (bvar nz) (ind_ty (pset_D b) nz)) (ind_ty (pset_D b) nz)))) w ∅ $ by closed0_den [s2, l95, l98, l99]
