l116: $ G , q = ∅ , y = dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (ind_ctor (pset_D b) nz nz)) w ∅ ⇒ i ∊ U₁ $ by weaken [l4]
l117: $ G , q = ∅ , y = dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (ind_ctor (pset_D b) nz nz)) w ∅ ⇒ ap y i ∈ (Πₛ h ∈ (Πₛ a ∈ i, dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (ind_ty (pset_D b) nz)) w ∅), dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (ind_ty (pset_D b) nz)) w ∅) $ by cpi_elim_ap [l115, l116]
