l135: $ G , i ∊ U₁ , f ∊ (Πₛ a ∈ i, psv u w b) , ∀ n (n ∊ i → ap f n ∈ {x | ∀ p ∀ q (⟨ x , p ⟩ ∈ pcol u w b → ⟨ x , q ⟩ ∈ pcol u w b → p = q)}) , z = ∅ +: i +: f +: ∅ , ⟨ z , p ⟩ ∈ pcol u w b , ⟨ z , q ⟩ ∈ pcol u w b , c ∊ U₁ ∧ d ∊ (Πₛ a ∈ c, psv u w b) ∧ m ∊ U₁ ∧ ∀ n (n ∊ c → ∃ y (y ∊ m ∧ ⟨ ap d n , y ⟩ ∈ pcol u w b)) ∧ ∀ y (y ∊ m → ∃ n (n ∊ c ∧ ⟨ ap d n , y ⟩ ∈ pcol u w b)) ∧ ⟨ z , p ⟩ = ⟨ ∅ +: c +: d +: ∅ , m ⟩ , ∃ g ∃ o (e ∊ U₁ ∧ g ∊ (Πₛ a ∈ e, psv u w b) ∧ o ∊ U₁ ∧ ∀ n (n ∊ e → ∃ y (y ∊ o ∧ ⟨ ap g n , y ⟩ ∈ pcol u w b)) ∧ ∀ y (y ∊ o → ∃ n (n ∊ e ∧ ⟨ ap g n , y ⟩ ∈ pcol u w b)) ∧ ⟨ z , q ⟩ = ⟨ ∅ +: e +: g +: ∅ , o ⟩) ⇒ ∃ g ∃ o (e ∊ U₁ ∧ g ∊ (Πₛ a ∈ e, psv u w b) ∧ o ∊ U₁ ∧ ∀ n (n ∊ e → ∃ y (y ∊ o ∧ ⟨ ap g n , y ⟩ ∈ pcol u w b)) ∧ ∀ y (y ∊ o → ∃ n (n ∊ e ∧ ⟨ ap g n , y ⟩ ∈ pcol u w b)) ∧ ⟨ z , q ⟩ = ⟨ ∅ +: e +: g +: ∅ , o ⟩) $ by ax
