l11: $ G , z = ∅ +: i +: f +: ∅ , t ∊ U₁ ∧ ⟨ z , t ⟩ ∈ pcol u w b ⇒ ⟨ z , t ⟩ ∈ pcol u w b $ by and_elim_r [l9]
