l46: $ G , z = ∅ +: i +: f +: ∅ , t ∊ U₁ ∧ ⟨ z , t ⟩ ∈ pcol u w b , c ∊ U₁ ∧ d ∊ (Πₛ a ∈ c, psv u w b) ∧ m ∊ U₁ ∧ ∀ n (n ∊ c → ∃ y (y ∊ m ∧ ⟨ ap d n , y ⟩ ∈ pcol u w b)) ∧ ∀ y (y ∊ m → ∃ n (n ∊ c ∧ ⟨ ap d n , y ⟩ ∈ pcol u w b)) ∧ ⟨ z , t ⟩ = ⟨ ∅ +: c +: d +: ∅ , m ⟩ , h ∊ t , n ∊ c ∧ ⟨ ap d n , h ⟩ ∈ pcol u w b ⇒ n ∊ i $ by welc_eq [eq_sym [l45], l43]
