l83: $ G , i ∊ U₁ , f ∊ (Πₛ a ∈ i, psv u w b) , ∀ n (n ∊ i → ap f n ∈ {yy0 | ∀ r (r ∊ psv u w b → (∅ ∈ ap (ap (cval u w E) yy0) r ↔ (pcol u w b)' yy0 = (pcol u w b)' r))}) , z = ∅ +: i +: f +: ∅ , r ∊ psv u w b , j ∊ U₁ ∧ g ∊ (Πₛ a ∈ j, psv u w b) ∧ r = ∅ +: j +: g +: ∅ , ∅ ∈ ap (ap (cval u w E) z) r , h ∊ {o | ∃ n (n ∊ i ∧ o = (pcol u w b)' (ap f n))} , n ∊ i ∧ h = (pcol u w b)' (ap f n) , ¬ h ∊ {o | ∃ m (m ∊ j ∧ o = (pcol u w b)' (ap g m))} , m ∊ j , ∅ ∈ ap (ap (cval u w E) (ap f n)) (ap g m) , k = ap f n , e = ap g m ⇒ ∀ r (r ∊ psv u w b → (∅ ∈ ap (ap (cval u w E) k) r ↔ (pcol u w b)' k = (pcol u w b)' r)) $ by cab_elim [l82]
